    delayBeforeSound: 0
    subtitleText: Thanks so much for trying this out. Every bit of data we collect
      helps improve the Director and its ability to create engaging experiences.
    subtitleDelay: 0
    subtitleDuration: 0
    useSoundLengthForSubtitleDuration: 1
    waitForSoundToFinish: 1
    secondsBeforeNextSound: 0
    delayAfterSound: 0
  - sound:
      Guid:
        Data1: 878319975
        Data2: 1282599015
        Data3: -731179381
        Data4: -2077485149
      Path: event:/VOICE/Intro/Intro_Part05
    delayBeforeSound: 0
    subtitleText: And I'm Catharina, the artist behind the Director's visual style.
    subtitleDelay: 0
    subtitleDuration: 0
    useSoundLengthForSubtitleDuration: 1
    waitForSoundToFinish: 1
    secondsBeforeNextSound: 0
    delayAfterSound: 0
  - sound:
      Guid:
        Data1: -901597480
        Data2: 1227509880
        Data3: -1429237106
        Data4: 623886595
      Path: event:/VOICE/Intro/Intro_Part06
    delayBeforeSound: 0
    subtitleText: To help train the model, please explore the environments it generates
      and label any notable objects you encounter using a preset list of emotions
      and concepts.
    subtitleDelay: 0
    subtitleDuration: 0
    useSoundLengthForSubtitleDuration: 1
    waitForSoundToFinish: 1
    secondsBeforeNextSound: 0
    delayAfterSound: 0
  - sound:
      Guid:
        Data1: -1305929296
        Data2: 1318570099
        Data3: -885768304
        Data4: -1782911690
      Path: event:/VOICE/Intro/Intro_Part07
    delayBeforeSound: 0
    subtitleText: 'We''re focused on the big ones: awe, beauty, death, dream, love,
      and mystery.'
    subtitleDelay: 0
    subtitleDuration: 0
    useSoundLengthForSubtitleDuration: 1
    waitForSoundToFinish: 1
    secondsBeforeNextSound: 0
    delayAfterSound: 0
  - sound:
      Guid:
        Data1: -518472300
        Data2: 1099330477
        Data3: 413533596
        Data4: 1354525335
      Path: event:/VOICE/Intro/Intro_Part08
    delayBeforeSound: 0
    subtitleText: Most AI Directors in games just manage the action, but the Hypsal
      Director is all about resonance.
    subtitleDelay: 0
    subtitleDuration: 0
    useSoundLengthForSubtitleDuration: 1
    waitForSoundToFinish: 1
    secondsBeforeNextSound: 0
    delayAfterSound: 0
  - sound:
      Guid:
        Data1: -621166890
        Data2: 1273910729
        Data3: -2029120889
        Data4: 7192483
      Path: event:/VOICE/Intro/Intro_Part09
    delayBeforeSound: 0
    subtitleText: It's learning other things too, so you may see other ideas, feelings,
      or moods.
    subtitleDelay: 0
    subtitleDuration: 0
    useSoundLengthForSubtitleDuration: 1
    waitForSoundToFinish: 1
    secondsBeforeNextSound: 0
    delayAfterSound: 0
  - sound:
      Guid:
        Data1: -2127401000
        Data2: 1152918722
        Data3: -139845734
        Data4: 1773526959
      Path: event:/VOICE/Intro/Intro_Part10
    delayBeforeSound: 0
    subtitleText: and everything you choose to label or ignore matters.
    subtitleDelay: 0
    subtitleDuration: 0
    useSoundLengthForSubtitleDuration: 1
    waitForSoundToFinish: 1
    secondsBeforeNextSound: 0
    delayAfterSound: 0
  - sound:
      Guid:
        Data1: -1270929537
        Data2: 1092612668
        Data3: -326805869
        Data4: 695429192
      Path: event:/VOICE/Intro/Intro_Part11
    delayBeforeSound: 0
    subtitleText: Yes, your movements, interactions, and decisions all provide important
      training data.
    subtitleDelay: 0
    subtitleDuration: 0
    useSoundLengthForSubtitleDuration: 1
    waitForSoundToFinish: 1
    secondsBeforeNextSound: 0
    delayAfterSound: 0
  - sound:
      Guid:
        Data1: 53862098
        Data2: 1209428461
        Data3: 334237576
        Data4: -1099659536
      Path: event:/VOICE/Intro/Intro_Part12
    delayBeforeSound: 0
    subtitleText: The Hypsal Director is still in alpha, so if you encounter any
      strange behavior or errors, then please let us know.
    subtitleDelay: 0
    subtitleDuration: 0
    useSoundLengthForSubtitleDuration: 1
    waitForSoundToFinish: 1
    secondsBeforeNextSound: 0
    delayAfterSound: 0
  - sound:
      Guid:
        Data1: 462475324
        Data2: 1283166706
        Data3: -37968966
        Data4: 786378200
      Path: event:/VOICE/Intro/Intro_Part13
    delayBeforeSound: 0
    subtitleText: Your help is truly appreciated.
    subtitleDelay: 0
    subtitleDuration: 0
    useSoundLengthForSubtitleDuration: 1
    waitForSoundToFinish: 1
    secondsBeforeNextSound: 0
    delayAfterSound: 0
  - sound:
      Guid:
        Data1: -1433090505
        Data2: 1206475701
        Data3: -1474234229
        Data4: 1148679451
      Path: event:/VOICE/Intro/Intro_Part14
    delayBeforeSound: 0
    subtitleText: The training will begin shortly!
